<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Nishat Mills falls 10.21 pct.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Nishat Mills falls 10.21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's largest textile mill, Nishat Mills Ltd, fell 10.21 percent on Monday on selling pressure in the over-bought market ahead of Tuesday's settlement day, dealers said.</p>
<p>The firm's 10-rupee stock, fell 2.9 rupees to 25.50 at midday with about 69,500 shares changing hands in early trading at the Karachi Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The Mill has not paid any dividend for the year ended September 30.</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan 9221 5685192</p>
